      "role_id": "qin_lie",
      "speaker_name": "秦烈",
      "text": "[laughs] [shouting] 腰挺直了！当年你们陆院长十八岁丹田碎了都没弯过半寸脊梁，如今没了血月锁命，你们这帮兔崽子倒娇气上了？",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "断岳武院高台上独臂老帅秦烈笑骂督训北渊寒门少年"
    },
    {
